OL,3,AKrakow shooting suspect has died in
OL,4,Ahospital, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials initially reported the gunman
OL,7,Fhad apparently been inspired by
OL,8,F"far-right ideologies", but have since
OL,9,Fsaid they are still investigating any
OL,10,Fpossible motivation.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
